self.KB_CONTENT["card:756344"]={"id":"card:756344","ty":"card","sourceId":"756344","title":"『品號成本價格清單』中的『輸入年月』為何？","ver":"iGP","topic":"品號","keywords":["品號","年月","價格"],"y":"other","answer":"* 需手輸入日期。* 若 列印月加權料工費='Y' 則 此欄位不可空白。進階選項","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:754889"]={"id":"card:754889","ty":"card","sourceId":"754889","title":"『單據分錄產生狀況表』中的『單別不同需跳頁』為何？","ver":"iGP","topic":"狀況表","keywords":["狀況表","單別","分錄","表單"],"y":"other","answer":"* 可勾選列印時單別不同時是否需跳頁。* 若勾選表單別不同要跳頁，反之，單別不同不要跳頁。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:755086"]={"id":"card:755086","ty":"card","sourceId":"755086","title":"『合約訂單建立作業』中的『交易條件 (TW039)』為何？","ver":"iGP","topic":"訂單","keywords":["訂單","交易","合約"],"y":"other","answer":"* 分為1.一般、2.FOB、3.C&F、4.C&I、5.CIF、6.FOB&C、7.C&F&C、8.C&I&C及9.CIF&C。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:756036"]={"id":"card:756036","ty":"card","sourceId":"756036","title":"『銷貨單明細表』中的『選擇銷貨日期 (TG003)』為何？","ver":"iGP","topic":"明細表","keywords":["明細表","銷貨單"],"y":"other","answer":"* 可點選 (icon)或[F2]日期快手，以銷貨單的「銷貨日期」作篩選，若空白表全部。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:753426"]={"id":"card:753426","ty":"card","sourceId":"753426","title":"『產生分錄底稿作業』中的『輸入單身序號間隔 (N2)』為何？","ver":"iGP","topic":"單身","keywords":["單身","分錄","底稿","序號"],"y":"other","answer":"* 預設每10筆單身序號為間隔。亦可修改，但不可空白。* 此欄位僅可輸入1~10之數值。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
